<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch stocks close 4.40 pct lower.</title>
<headline>Dutch stocks close 4.40 pct lower.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch shares closed sharply lower on Friday, with the AEX index of 25 blue chip shares ending 4.40 percent lower at 894.42 points.</p>
<p>It was the second time this week that the index had fallen more than four percent in a single day.</p>
<p>Friday's fall took the index's cumulative loss since the all-time closing high of 1,010.97 on August 7 to 11.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
